WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:05.150
How would you like to keep singing as part of the same team from now on, Sophie?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.550
I'd love to.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.820
Really?

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.740
Thank you so much!

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.340
I'm sorry.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.080
My Friend Ticket...

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:02.840
This sucks-pri.

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:06.740
Sophie looked really sad when she gave this back.

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:10.100
What could have changed her mind so suddenly?

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.080
Yeah, it's weird-pri.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:17.790
Hey there, lovelies! Care to join me for a drink?

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:18.800
We'll pass.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.410
You there!

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:25.370
How about we make this autumn special together-kuma?

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:27.580
G-Get away from me!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.940
Why's everyone keep avoiding me-kuma?

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.920
Why are you wasting time trying to pick up girls-pri?

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:36.090
Seriously. We're trying to figure out the situation with Sophie over here.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.020
Don't misunderstand-kuma!
I'm doing respectable work here!

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:40.980
I'm scouting for a new member!

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:41.930
Scouting?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:45.140
The big event is at the end of the month-kuma.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.150
Right, the Grand Prix Live-pri.

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:53.620
I gotta find that third member soon, or I won't be able to relax in preparation for my hibernation.

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:54.660
There he goes again...

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.610
But Sophie's our third member!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:00.320
Give up on Sophie-kuma. She already declined-kuma.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.610
Right-usa.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.830
Don't go forgetting that I hear all.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:10.090
And what are you up to, all shady-like?

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:13.730
Surely you wouldn't be trying to rope our Sophie into your little team?

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.060
Quit screwing around-usa!

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:21.850
But Sophie said she'd join our team before!

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:22.970
Impossible!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.570
Hell will freeze over before that happens-usa.

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:28.930
After all, Sophie does whatever I, her manager, tell her to.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.890
I don't like your tone.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.130
It's the truth-usa.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.440
She's out of your reach either way-usa.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.690
What do you mean-pri?

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.030
Exactly what I said-usa.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.930
Sophie has her career to consider.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:48.400
She and someone all the way down at Good Student rank are like pearls and swine-usa.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.000
But...

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.470
It's "pearls before swine" and it implies not understanding the value of something!

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.150
You're looking for "Apples and oranges"-pri!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.930
Shut up, you-usa! Adieu!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.720
What a jerk!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.280
He...

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.300
It's Usagi-kuma.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.890
He doesn't care about Sophie at all!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.370
Mr. Kuma!

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:10.310
What-kuma?

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:13.260
I'll go see Sophie about this again.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:15.980
So don't go looking for a new member just yet!

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:19.730
Are you even listening to yourself-kuma? This is a kuma waste of time! Geez!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.440
Please!

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:21.090
I said no alre—

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:21.800
Thanks!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:22.950
I'm going then! See you!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.660
Hey! I already said no!

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:29.080
Hey! Not you too!

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.790
I guess that's how it's gonna be-kuma...

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.790
You have until noon tomorrow-kuma! Not a minute longer-kuma!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:36.850
Capisce!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.690
Gotcha! Pri!

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.130
Make way-chanko!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:45.160
The show's over and Sophie's about to head out.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.890
We need to get in front.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.770
Sophie! Sophie!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.610
Wait!

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.740
You again!

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:01.880
Chanko!

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.600
We can't have you stalking Lady Sophie around.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.150
Chanko!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.290
But why did Sophie return my Friend Ticket?

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.650
That is none of your business!

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.410
Keep away from us.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.910
Wait up-pri!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:20.250
Sophie wants her true face to be accepted-pri.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.050
Wh-What do you mean?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.510
During that variety show...

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:28.580
<i>Everyone only likes my stage personality.</i>

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.430
That's what she said to Lala-pri.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.890
How about you? Do you accept it-pri?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.090
You have no right to ask something like that!

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.660
Stop leading Lady Sophie astray!

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.030
Yeah-chanko! I've had enough of you-chanko!

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.480
Chanko, let's just go.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:46.860
I can't stand these two-chanko.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.050
Anyway, no more meddling.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:53.100
We know Lady Sophie's needs best!

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:59.190
We didn't get to see her.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.040
Lala...

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.380
Sophie... I can't just abandon her. We can't just abandon her!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.050
Oh yeah! I had something up my sleeve all along!

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.550
Come over to my place tomorrow!

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.510
Something up your sleeve?

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:16.480
So this was what was up your sleeve?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:20.230
If we can't get to her in PriPara, we'll just go straight to her home!

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:24.630
I see. And the shortest way to a person's heart is through the stomach.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.010
This might just work.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:30.660
Yes? Oh, pizza delivery?

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:32.580
Just a moment.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:34.790
Thank you.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.100
Oh? We've met before.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:41.310
So you always delivered the pizza too!

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.740
So, how much do I owe you?

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:44.760
Uh, these are on the house.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:47.900
We were actually hoping we could talk to Sophie.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.460
So we thought we'd bring some pizza of our own accord.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:52.510
Oh, I see.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:57.060
Cosmic sorry though. Sophie's at PriPara right now.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.230
Uh, pardon me, but aren't you Houjou Cosmo?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.980
I am indeed! How'd you know?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.330
Why wouldn't I?

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:10.160
Houjou Cosmo, the fashion leader with a space aura.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:13.300
You're one of the most famous designer personalities around!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.410
And you're Sophie's older sister.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.450
R-Really?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.920
Really. You're in her debt too.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:26.400
All those amazing Cyalume Coords we use while performing are her designs too.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.700
You're pretty well read.

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:32.430
Yes! You're an inspiration to all us girls!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.830
Oh, you! That makes me cosmic happy to hear!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.100
Would you like to come in for tea?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.310
Yes!

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:44.680
I see. You were the ones Sophie promised to team up with.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:45.930
Yeah.

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:50.360
That was the first time she brought up wanting to team up with anyone.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.410
But she declined us yesterday.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:58.620
It's probably okay to tell you this.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.790
Just yesterday,

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:05.670
she tried to get to PriPara all on her own, and failed.

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:10.050
It seemed to shake her confidence quite a bit.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.840
So that's what happened...

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:14.550
It gave me a lot to think about, too.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:23.350
I've been looking after her outside, and in PriPara she has the manager and those Royal Guard girls taking care of her.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:27.480
But I'm starting to wonder if that's really been a good thing for her.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:32.900
I think Sophie might want to fly on her own, as it were.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.490
Feel free to come over again.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.700
Yes, thank you.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.360
Um...

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.050
Please relay this message to Sophie for me.

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:50.300
If she's really going to give up after just one failure, she wouldn't even have been fit for our team.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:55.890
If she really does want to fly,
we're ready to offer any help we can.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.970
But she will have to take the first step on her own.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.180
On her own...

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.140
On her own.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:15.740
I've calculated that our chances of teaming up with Sophie have gone down by 98%.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.330
Nigh impossible.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:19.160
No way.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:22.980
Lala.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.050
It really is a pity about Sophie.

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:29.460
But we've both done all we can for her.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.310
Let's give up on Sophie.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.290
What?

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:34.900
The event is almost here!

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.040
Mireille...

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:37.980
Yeah?

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:38.650
What is it?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:41.100
The Sophie deal was a no-go, right-kuma?

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:45.940
Well, back to the drawing board.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:46.830
True enough.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:50.270
Let's switch our focus to finding someone else for our new member!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.730
Interviews?

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:55.390
Okay then, it's about time to, uh,

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:58.890
start the auditions for our unit's third member!

00:09:58.890 --> 00:09:59.690
Auditions?

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:00.950
Those interviews-kuma.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:04.660
Okay! First in line, come on in-kuma!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:13.590
<i>She might be our new member?</i>

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:27.730
Okay, first candidate, Keiko. Please introduce yourself to us-kuma.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.730
Uh... Excuse me, but...

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.500
I get really nervous in these situations so...

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.740
You wouldn't mind if I introduced myself with a song?

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:39.200
Sure, please go ahead-kuma.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.740
Check it out! I'mma drop some introduction!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.800
I'm a rapper and I dig gukbap

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:48.080
Sprinklin' pepper, pourin' tea thru a strainer

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.000
Hey, keep up! I like Soccer, call me a kicker

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.290
Stop!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.810
We get it-kuma! You may go-kuma!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:57.260
That's some gap.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:00.970
There's nothing wrong with rap, but I don't know that she'd really mesh with us.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.220
Let's move on-kuma!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:05.450
Number two! Come on in-kuma!

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:13.630
As songs are born of the world,
so in turn is the world born of songs.

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:17.990
The diva of the Heisei era, Matsubara Keiko will sing to you:

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.780
"Waiting for you at Lover's Cape"

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:26.790
My dearest, my dearest, how I despi—

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.710
Please go away-kuma!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:34.170
I guess old school enka isn't bad either, but I don't really see it working out for us...

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:37.670
Well, let's just move on without skipping a beat.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:39.970
Next-kuma!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.380
Thank you! You're too kind!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.090
Next!

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:42.740
Parakappa!

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:44.090
Next kappa!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:44.970
Parakappa!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:49.560
What kind of standards did you have for the selection, Kuma?

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:54.010
I guess we just happened to attract a crowd with some more... unique interests.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.420
I want Sophie!

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:59.650
Stop comparing everyone to Sophie-kuma!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.940
No, I understand now.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:06.160
Sophie is the only one I can imagine teaming up with.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:07.870
No one else will feel right.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:11.460
You know that's impossible with Usagi around-kuma.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.790
That manager, Usagi...

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.290
<i>Like pearls and swine-usa.</i>

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.730
Mr. Kuma! Book me with a ton of solo events!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.590
I'll get my rank higher!

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.460
That won't do anything to change his mind.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:27.550
I don't care! We've tried everything else, this is all I can do now!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:33.150
Well, I guess getting your rank up would be good anyway... Fine-kuma.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:37.980
But no skipping out on training and rehearsals even with the extra shows-kuma.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.680
You better be ready-kuma.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:40.710
Capisce!

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:52.660
Some girls, Lala and Mireille, came over earlier and brought that pizza.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.760
Another solo performance? Very well.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.810
I'm back! And going back out!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.810
Make-y, make-y!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.520
1 liter is a 1000 milliliters, but how many likes is 1 live show?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.770
Lala!

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.410
Thanks for showing up!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.510
She's almost shockingly tireless-pri.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.510
She's like a PriPara addict.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.310
It sure is quiet without Lala backstage.

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:00.020
Sorry to keep you waiting-kuma!

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:01.700
I wasn't really waiting-pri.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:06.580
Your supremely capable manager, Kuma, has brought the long-awaited eighth candidate-kuma!

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:07.630
You found someone?

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:09.240
Please, do come in.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.870
I'm Dorothy! Nice to meet ya!

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.450
Team up with me, and your happiness is guaranteed!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.680
Uh, nice to meet you.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:21.030
Dorothy wants to observe one of your team performances before making a final decision-kuma.

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:22.640
Sounds pri-tty sensible to me.

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.170
I wouldn't want you to join up blind either.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:26.800
See ya!

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:29.760
She seems good-pri.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:33.470
It's time to unveil the new Making Drama.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:35.990
We have absolute faith in your ability.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.400
Allow me to introduce

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.960
your new teammates, New and Mew-usa!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:46.220
Nice to mewt you, I'm New.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.860
I'm Mew! Nice to mewt you!

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:51.320
Pleased to meet you.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:56.900
Meowh? Not even going to stand up for us? Even though we're higher ranked <i>and</i> in high school?

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:59.080
Kids these days have such poor meownners.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.940
Excuse me-chanko?

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:07.760
Please excuse us, but Lady Sophie can't possibly get up while having her hair brushed.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:13.870
There there. These two have been in the PriPara business for 10 whole years!

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.430
They're above even Sophie, Major class-usa!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:20.720
Major class? They're really among the chosen few in Major class?

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:25.900
And as part of this team Sophie will also be able to participate in Major class events-usa!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:30.500
We'll have a gorgeous bigger dressing room! Isn't that great, Lady Sophie?

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:34.950
U-Uh... Lady Sophie? Lady Sophie?

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:38.300
And New and Mew are famous for their dance skills-usa!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.540
They're perfect for backing Sophie up-usa!

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:44.820
We're meowre backup dancers to you?

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:47.880
High schoolers as meowre back up for a middle school kid?

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:51.970
Here I am, Mireille!

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:56.830
You gonna be okay? You've already done 3 shows today-pri!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:57.720
Totally fine!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:03.230
But you know, these solo ones are okay, but performing together with you is at least twice as fun!

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:08.150
And imagine how great it would be if we got Sophie along too!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.650
Oh, Lala, about that...

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:12.210
Hm?

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:13.710
Well, Kuma just showed up and—

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:15.660
Hey! It's starting-kuma!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:16.820
Capisce!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.190
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:24.160
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.260
Coord Change Start!

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.780
The Fresh Lime and Fresh Orange Coords.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:37.230
Candy Ala Mode's two most popular coords right now. Let's PriPara!

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:38.180
Fresh Lime!

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:41.100
Fresh Orange! Pri!

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:31.210
Making Drama Switch On!

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:48.170
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.550
Cyalume Change!

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:06.770
Lala's Prism Voice is getting better and better-kuma!

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:09.560
It's a real storm of likes for that one!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.820
Congratulations!

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:16.450
With this time's results, Lala has made it to Debut class!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.380
Eh?

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:19.320
Lala! Congratulations-pri!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:22.910
I did it! I finally got my rank up!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.370
Congratulations-kuma!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.900
Good work-kuma!

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.840
Thanks, Mr. Kuma!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.330
Congratulations on ranking up.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:35.800
But this might just be the last time you get to meet Sophie down here in Debut class-usa.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.300
What's that mean-kuma?

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:45.020
You don't get it? Sophie's landed a position in a team with Idols ranking far, far above you-usa.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.370
What? Sophie...

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:50.420
Well the big event is getting really close...

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.110
B-But...

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:57.070
And finally, time for today's main event with Sophie!

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:42.800
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.520
Liberation Maiden! Valkyrie!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:20:00.920
I can't reach it!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.510
Lady Sophie!

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.210
Cyalume Change!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.730
That Making Drama was the best!

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:54.620
So cool!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.940
Splendidly done, Lady Sophie!

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.690
That new Making Drama was really good!

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:04.460
It's incomplete.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:13.180
<i>A Making Drama conveys the performer's emotions.</i>

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.720
<i>Being locked in that cage...</i>

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:19.240
<i>That's what she feels like.</i>

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.720
Sophie wants to get out of her cage!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:25.380
I'm going to rescue her from there!

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:09.990
What? Sophie's teaming up with some other duo?

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.400
We can't enter that event without three members-pri!

00:23:13.400 --> 00:23:15.020
We're in big trouble!

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:18.050
What could this feeling be?

00:23:18.050 --> 00:23:20.460
What should I do?

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:23.670
What's more important than Red Flash?

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:24.750
It's...

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:29.030
Sophie! I want to free you from your cage!

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:31.570
Next time: Spread Your Wings, Sophie!

00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:34.970
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
